(126, 70, '程序清单 3-14　ComputePI.java', '1  public class ComputePI {\n2    public static void main(String[] args) {\n3      int numerator = 1;       //分子\n4      int denominator = 1;     //分母\n5      int i = 0;               //累加项序号，从零开始编号\n6      double item = 1;         //当前项的值,初始化为第一项的值\n7      double sum = 0;          //累加和，初始值是 0\n8      while (Math.abs(item) > 1E-7){\n9         sum = sum + item;\n10        i++;                  //项编号自增\n11        denominator = 2 * i + 1;\n12        numerator = -numerator; //分子正负号变换\n13        item = (double)numerator / denominator;\n14     }\n15     System.out.println("PI 的近似值为："+ 4 * sum);\n16   }\n17 }', 0, 121, 58),
